<title>JAPAN: Kobe Steel sees 97/98 prnt current up. [CORRECTED 09:44 GMT].</title>
<headline>Kobe Steel sees 97/98 prnt current up. [CORRECTED 09:44 GMT].</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects year from 96/97).</p>
<p>Kobe Steel Ltd said on Thursday that it aimed to post a parent current profit of more than 30 billion yen in the year to March 31, 1998, against its forecast of a 27 billion yen profit in 1996/97.</p>
